Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:49.10,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:49.10,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}6-4 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 大坂直美 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Your first ever WTA 500 final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你生涯第一个 WTA 500 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I got so many things to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有一大堆问题想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,about, but you were just looking up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你刚才一直抬头看大屏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,at that big board and watching the emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着那一刻的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,between you and your coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在你和你的教练之间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and your own self.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,也在你自己心里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What does this moment mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一刻对你意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,O, I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还说不上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I'm still locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我还在状态里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Like, I don't think it's over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉这事儿还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It's over. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,结束了 已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,one more match I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就还剩一场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,But um super super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但真的非常非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I played really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course such a meaningful match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然这也是一场很有分量的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.16,EN,,0,0,0,,against a great player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是一位了不起的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Um so really happy to share the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能和大坂直美同场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,with Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can I ask you you had a you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能问一下吗 你们在网前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,had a really lovely exchange there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,有过一次很动人的交流
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,at the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在球网边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Um and also you didn't show a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你赢下来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of emotion when you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,并没有表现出太多情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you just take me into the mindset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能带我进到你的心里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of what that meant to you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢下这样一位对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to to beat someone like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你到底意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:59.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like I said, it's such an honor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我说的 这是莫大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to to share the court with her, but I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,能和她同场 但我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, it's with I guess just the way I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜跟我怎么面对这场球有关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,approach today's match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, could never count her out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你永远不能把她当成已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, and and like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我刚才也说了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I was so I had to be so locked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我必须非常非常专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in and I made it a point to be so locked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是刻意让自己一直绷着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,in, which is why until now I'm still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以到现在我还没出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,in that mode of of kind of competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种比赛的状态里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh, I need time to let it sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我需要一点时间才消化得了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,What about the support here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那现场的支持呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,All week all week you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周 整整一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,have been without a doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你毫无疑问是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the most popular player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最受欢迎的那位球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that we have had on this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这片场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a phenomenal response
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,全场的反应好得惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有人都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What does that mean to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对你意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and how much did that help you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天又帮了你多少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It helped me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮了我特别多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that you guys enjoyed the match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们享受了这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:56.56,EN,,0,0,0,,or at least it it sounded like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少听起来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得有那么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,was a really good couple points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,几分球 几次来回打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,couple exchanges
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,几次交锋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,which I think made it super exciting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,让整场比赛特别精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and the level here in this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且这站赛事的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is really so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很高
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,We have the best of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,来的都是最好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So you know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,this tournament doesn't deserve anything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的赛事配得上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.44,EN,,0,0,0,,than the best fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So the final Jessica Pegula,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么决赛对手是佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,she has won this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,她拿过这站的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,before many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多年前了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You played her last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你去年跟她打过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,a phenomenal three- set match in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在迈阿密 一场精彩的三盘大战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,She just got you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在那儿险胜了你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What can you do tomorrow to change
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天你能做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,把结果掉过来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,H I'll have to ask my coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那我得问我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,He'll know best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,他最清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,No, I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,But um yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过说正经的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I just have to trust myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想我只需要相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh I'm in the final for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能站在决赛里是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:45.44,EN,,0,0,0,,She is such an amazing player also
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,她也是一位非常出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,同样是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So I think it's going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得这会是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:49.10,EN,,0,0,0,,to be a really good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场很好的比赛
